   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ae808bb42c0e06d8f7a6414\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"82e32f905b56dcca7ce5\" id=\"block-82e32f905b56dcca7ce5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">While we are loving all of the new and exciting places we've been this year, we are missing one of our all-time favorites, so we're bringing it back.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Bundle up and join us this week for a morning stroll along the beautiful horseneck beach. This time, with all of our furry friends</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-82e32f905b56dcca7ce5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-82e32f905b56dcca7ce5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-82e32f905b56dcca7ce5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-r