  {
   "id": "6ae80498fc0ba71722c33dca",
   "urlId": "35k47tdkh990g2amdbmgpuase6wrwo",
   "title": "Sunrise Stroll",
   "startDate": 1794052800336,
   "endDate": 1794060000336,
   "fullUrl": "/our-schedule/35k47tdkh990g2amdbmgpuase6wrwo",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Inspired by early birds like our ambassador and host this week <a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/610897797967366/user/56501615/?__cft__[0]=AZhWe9aObEFJX0hbhzC-KKpR4nF_2vxd6cZdet3X7S6zfT51yQp1aXdbaMGZ8h-CbVigPo6Jx4jkUU8jnHTR1bv0llNi46RM54Rw7wCHXF3gvY6-l9APPhcPI5UWwy5DtFYPF0ruqf4GXhf6VAwZ&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\"><strong>Meg Feeney</strong></a>, this walk lets you get your steps in early, grab a smoothie from <strong>Farm2Cup</strong>, and still have a full, action-packed day ahead.</p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ae80498fc0ba71722c33dca\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"3e66f4351390a45617eb\" id=\"block-3e66f4351390a45617eb\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This one is for all of our early birds who like to get their day started with the sun. Join our incredible ambassador, Meg for an early morning stroll through Fairhaven, and kick off our Winter giving initiative, the Walk for Warmth. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-3e66f4351390a45617eb {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-3e66f4351390a45617eb .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-3e66f4351390a45617eb {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n