   "fullUrl": "/our-schedule/kettle-point-east-providence",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The first of two walks for the day, we are heading to East providence to start our morning with a Troll Hunt and a beautiful 3 mile stroll along a new section of the east bay bike path. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">We will have an abbreviated social hour this morning from 9:30-10 with our walk starting at 10</p>",
