   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ac2ec80deac3d00c7763fb4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a7017215-5bf6-49ab-84eb-1a4e39debf09_1045/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"e18ce2cc1ef5df3f5ae5\" id=\"block-e18ce2cc1ef5df3f5ae5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Unfortunately, our last attempt at this one got rained out, so we're finally getting it back on the calendar.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This week we are partnering with the wonderful women at Community Nurse and hosting a special walk to remember those we've lost, support those currently navigating a diagnosis, and honor the caregivers who walk this journey every day.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Whether you are walking in memory of a family member, in honor of someone fighting the disease, or to support our community, we are asking everyone to wear purple if you can to show support.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-e18ce2cc1ef5df3f5ae5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(v